<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 95 0 R
/T (Hospital readmission is an important concern for healthcare providers because a patient returning to hospital soon after discharge may require additional care and resources. This project develops a machine learning-based system to classify hospital encounters according to whether the patient is readmitted within 30 days. The work uses the Diabetes 130-US Hospitals dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository. The workflow includes data exploration, cleaning, feature preparation, patient-based train-test splitting, model training, model comparison and application development.)
/E (Hospital readmission is an important concern for healthcare providers because a patient returning to hospital soon after discharge may require additional care and resources. This project develops a machine learning-based system to classify hospital encounters according to whether the patient is readmitted within 30 days. The work uses the Diabetes 130-US Hospitals dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository. The workflow includes data exploration, cleaning, feature preparation, patient-based train-test splitting, model training, model comparison and application development.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
