/E (For Logistic Regression, the reported positive-class precision was 0.1544 and positive-class recall was 0.5328. Its F1-score was 0.2934. This indicates that the model identified approximately 53% of the actual positive cases, although a substantial proportion of its positive predictions were incorrect. The model demonstrates a useful classification workflow but still requires improvement and further validation.)
