666 0 obj
<<
/Title (Hospital readmission is an important concern for healthcare providers because a patient returning to hospital soon after discharge may require additional care and resources. This project develops a machine learning-based system to classify hospital encounters according to whether the patient is readmitted within 30 days. The work uses the Diabetes 130-US Hospitals dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository. The workflow includes data exploration, cleaning, feature preparation, patient-based train-test splitting, model training, model comparison and application development.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 470 0 R
/Next 813 0 R
>>
endobj
667 0 obj
<<
/Title (I would like to express my sincere gratitude to Bleep Education for providing me with the opportunity to work on this project, Diabetes Readmission Risk Prediction. This project has been a valuable learning experience that helped me strengthen my practical knowledge of data analysis, machine learning, and application development.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 470 0 R
/Prev 813 0 R
>>
endobj
