<<
/Title (Healthcare organizations collect data from admissions, diagnoses, procedures, medication orders and discharge records. These records can be analysed to understand patterns in patient outcomes. One relevant outcome is readmission within 30 days of discharge. A model that identifies patterns associated with this outcome may support research into discharge planning and follow-up processes.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 814 0 R
/Next 969 0 R
>>
endobj
891 0 obj
