/Title (The comparison illustrates why several metrics are needed for imbalanced classification. A model may achieve high overall accuracy by predicting the majority class while failing to detect the minority class. F1-score and recall provide additional information about positive-class detection, while precision indicates how many positive predictions were correct.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 817 0 R
>>
endobj
