<<
/Title (Machine learning provides methods for learning statistical patterns from historical examples. In this project, the task is treated as binary classification: encounters labelled as readmitted within 30 days form the positive class, while encounters labelled as not readmitted within 30 days form the negative class. The system is an academic prototype and does not provide medical advice.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 814 0 R
/Prev 890 0 R
/Next 891 0 R
>>
