/Title (Hospitals maintain extensive encounter records, but manually reviewing large numbers of records to identify patterns associated with 30-day readmission can be difficult. This project investigates whether selected patient and encounter attributes can be used by supervised machine learning algorithms to classify encounters as likely to belong to the 30-day readmission category.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 970 0 R
/Next 1013 0 R
>>
endobj
1013 0 obj
<<
/Title (The project predicts a historical outcome category; it does not establish that any patient characteristic causes readmission, nor does it establish that using the model will reduce readmission rates.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 970 0 R
/Prev 1012 0 R
>>
endobj
