<<
/Title (A patient-based split was used so that encounters belonging to the same patient would not be placed in both the training and test partitions. GroupShuffleSplit was used with patient number as the grouping variable and a test fraction of 20% \(random_state 42, as recorded in the project workflow\). This is important because multiple encounters from one patient can otherwise create an overly optimistic evaluation.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1046 0 R
>>
endobj
